  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 375 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together flour, salt, and black pepper.",
    "In a separate bowl, mix together ricotta cheese, grapefruit juice, and bonito flakes.",
    "Add the wet ingredients to the dry ingredients and mix until a dough forms.",
    "Roll out the dough on a floured surface to about 1 inch thickness.",
    "Cut into desired shapes using a cookie cutter or a glass.",
    "Place biscuits on a baking sheet lined with parchment paper.",
    "Dot the top of each biscuit with unsalted butter.",
    "Bake for 15 minutes, or until lightly golden brown.",
    "Allow biscuits to cool on a wire rack for 5 minutes before serving."
